WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The user can filter using Description, Avalibility, Category, and Owner.
"Clear filters" removes all filters done at once.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:29.000
When The user goes to the Card view, The user get items grouped by the parent category.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:38.100
The arrow on the right corner of the card lists out all the items under that group.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:01:00.000
The user can filter using Description, Reservation start and end date, and Category.
Same as before "Clear filters" removes all filters at once.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:27.200
The user can add items by clicking the "Add items" button. It takes us to this page.

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:50.250
The user must then fill out all the required details.
Then click on "Submit".

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:26.300
The system will redirect us back to the list card page and send a 
success notification if the item has been added successfully, a failed notification if not.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:35.350
If successful, the user can now see the item they added in this page.
They can also find it through filtering.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:50.400
If The user clicks on the item, they are directed to the "Item Details" page.

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:55.450
Every detail added by the user is then displayed here.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.500
The color changes depending on the availbility status.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:24.000
This concludes my demo.
ThankYou!
